ai-rossby
=========

This repository is a fork of NVIDIA PhysicsNeMo (Apache License 2.0; see
LICENSE.txt) with additional weather- and climate-emulation code developed at
The University of Chicago. It also contains code derived from two external
research codebases. This NOTICE records that provenance.

